# Yume deployment

Guarded by `src/config/deployment.test.ts` and `src-tauri/tauri.conf.json`. Do not reverse.

## Installers (no admin)

| Platform | Ship | Do not ship |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Windows | NSIS `.exe` with `installMode: currentUser` | WiX `.msi`, `perMachine`, `both` (UAC + Program Files) |
| macOS | `.app` + drag-and-drop `.dmg` | `.pkg` |

`bundle.targets` is the explicit list `["nsis", "app", "dmg"]` — never `"all"`.

Windows current-user NSIS installs under `%LOCALAPPDATA%`. Registry: `HKCU`. A standard user must install with **no UAC prompt**.

## Data writes (always user-scoped)

| File | Path API |
| --- | --- |
| SQLite `vocab_pet.db` | `appLocalDataDir()` |
| `settings.json` | `appDataDir()` |

Identifier: `com.hoangquyen.yume`. Never write into the install directory, Program Files, `/Applications`, or `/Library`.
